   'Partner Weston honors U.S. Drug Enforcement Administration Special Agent Michael E. Weston, 37, assigned to the Kabul Country Office in Kabul, Afghanistan. He was killed on Oct. 29, 2009, when the helicopter he was in crashed in western Afghanistan.

With a partner, you complete 5 rounds of a 1,000 m row, a 200 m dumbbell farmers carry, and a 50 m single-dumbbell waiters walk with each arm. The dumbbells are 45 lb / 35 lb. Only one partner works at a time. CrossFit does not say how to divide the work, so agree on your split before you start. The long rows and carries test your grip and shoulders more than your speed.',
   '[{"name": "Row", "reps": "1,000 m", "tip": "Drive with your legs first, then lean back and pull. Keep a pace you can hold for every round."}, {"name": "DB Farmer Carry", "reps": "200 m", "tip": "One dumbbell in each hand at your sides, shoulders back, short quick steps.", "rx_men": "45 lb", "rx_women": "35 lb"}, {"name": "Waiter''s Walk", "reps": "50 m, right arm", "tip": "Hold one dumbbell overhead with a locked arm and walk tall. Keep your ribs down.", "rx_men": "45 lb", "rx_women": "35 lb"}, {"name": "Waiter''s Walk", "reps": "50 m, left arm", "tip": "Switch to the left arm and keep the dumbbell stacked over your shoulder.", "rx_men": "45 lb", "rx_women": "35 lb"}]'::jsonb,
   'Record your team''s finish time.',
