   'Paul Pena honors Army Capt. Paul Pena, 27, of San Marcos, Texas, assigned to the 2nd Battalion, 508th Parachute Regiment, 4th Brigade Combat Team, 82nd Airborne Division. He died on Jan. 19, 2010, from wounds sustained from an improvised explosive device while leading a patrol in the Arghandab River Valley in Afghanistan. He enjoyed running, burpees, push-ups and pull-ups.

You complete 7 rounds of a 100 m sprint, 19 kettlebell swings (70 lb / 53 lb) and 10 burpee box jumps (24 in / 20 in), with 3 minutes of rest between rounds. Each round is timed on its own, so every round is a hard sprint. The rest lets you go fast, but the burpees catch up with you.',
   '[{"name": "Sprint", "reps": "100 m", "tip": "Fast but controlled. Stay tall and drive your arms."}, {"name": "Kettlebell Swings", "reps": "19", "tip": "Snap your hips and swing the bell overhead with straight arms.", "rx_men": "70 lb", "rx_women": "53 lb"}, {"name": "Burpee Box Jumps", "reps": "10", "tip": "Chest to the floor, stand, jump onto the box and stand tall.", "rx_men": "24 in", "rx_women": "20 in"}, {"name": "Rest", "reps": "3 min", "isRest": true, "tip": "Rest 3 minutes between rounds. Walk, breathe and get ready to sprint again."}]'::jsonb,
   'Record each round''s time. CrossFit does not say how to score the rounds, so add them together for a total and note your slowest round.',
