Wearing a weight vest (20 lb / 14 lb), you complete 7 rounds of a 400 m run, 21 walking lunges, 15 pull-ups and 9 burpees. None of the movements is hard alone, but the vest and the volume make this long. CrossFit does not say how to count the lunges, so pick a standard and keep it for every round.',
