   'Ricky honors U.S. Army Sgt. William "Ricky" Rudd, 27, of Madisonville, Kentucky, assigned to the 3rd Battalion, 75th Ranger Regiment at Fort Benning, Georgia. He died on Oct. 5, 2008, from wounds from enemy small-arms fire while on a combat patrol in Mosul, Iraq.

For 20 minutes you do as many rounds as possible of 10 pull-ups, 5 dumbbell deadlifts (75 lb / 50 lb dumbbells) and 8 barbell push presses (135 lb / 95 lb). The rounds are short, so the score comes from moving steadily. Your grip works on both the pull-ups and the heavy dumbbells, and the push presses tire your shoulders.',
   '[{"name": "Pull-Ups", "reps": "10", "tip": "Chin clears the bar on every rep. Kipping is fine."}, {"name": "Dumbbell Deadlifts", "reps": "5", "tip": "One dumbbell in each hand at your sides. Flat back, stand all the way up.", "rx_men": "75 lb", "rx_women": "50 lb"}, {"name": "Push Press", "reps": "8", "tip": "Dip and drive with your legs, then press the bar to lockout.", "rx_men": "135 lb", "rx_women": "95 lb"}]'::jsonb,
